{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787188216299152001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"cordial-loopy-beagle","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"30fc309cc9777234c4176ac89de18afede1566418b80be3c10c1d54f78478cb9","event_uuid":"1f90aa5f-b767-4b28-b07d-0079262cd044","position":{"commit_sha":"b0cdd53b4b4549deae5d473b5b94716d7f2a243e","position":"1787185933285266001-1f90aa5f-b767-4b28-b07d-0079262cd044"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"a47323d9a75aee765034866b57d69bb1fdcc47d3c9a75b18f36972c96a738252","event_uuid":"52b72803-5ac8-4d7e-8786-7cb17d6e13fb","position":{"commit_sha":"7295232c895a468a731a61f7335cd234978768d1","position":"1787186101719409001-52b72803-5ac8-4d7e-8786-7cb17d6e13fb"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787185933285266001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## What\n\n`src/rebar/audit/page.py:329` computes `\"lacking\": kind == \"operator-attested\" and not met`.\nWiden to accept `\"non-codebase\"` as well.\n\n## Why reader-first\n\n827 of 4,285 tickets in the live store hold COMPLETION_VERDICT events carrying\n`kind: \"operator-attested\"`. Those are immutable. The reader must accept both BEFORE S5 changes\nwhat the verifier emits, or the audit page silently stops flagging un-attested criteria on\neither the old or the new records.\n\nBlast radius verified: this is the ONLY site in the codebase comparing a criterion `kind`\nagainst the string; the schema declares `kind` as unconstrained `\"type\": \"string\"` with no enum,\nso nothing else validates it. `page.py` is 402 LOC with no complexity-baseline entry.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] A PASS verdict whose criterion carries `kind: \"operator-attested\"` and `met: false` renders\n      with `lacking: true`.\n- [ ] The same verdict with `kind: \"non-codebase\"` renders identically.\n- [ ] A `codebase-verifiable` criterion is unaffected in both cases.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/audit/page.py","reason":"accept both kind values when computing the lacking flag"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_audit_ticket_page_heldout.py","reason":"cover both kind values"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","6f5a-4a49-7bbf-4a30"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"6f5a-4a49-7bbf-4a30","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"a356-d8e4-d970-42a0","ticket_type":"story","title":"S2 — accept both kind values when rendering the audit page (reader-first)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["1f90aa5f-b767-4b28-b07d-0079262cd044","52b72803-5ac8-4d7e-8786-7cb17d6e13fb"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787188216299152001,"uuid":"03942b25-1870-49e9-aad3-ac9293f81859"}